{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 42","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are positive integers, the radicals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f268248f5b5268c5a66efa0642be639ad9113cf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a+\\frac{b}{c}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f85785c09c8cffb03b4f6695fa735c5e70671a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\sqrt{\\frac{b}{c}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"39\" height=\"43\" /> are equal when and only when: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63ad942aef00932e8af157d47018b5dce5b4fe0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a=b=c=1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ a=b\\text{ and }c=a=1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ c=\\frac{b(a^2-1)}{a}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ a=b\\text{ and }c\\text{ is any value}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ a=b\\text{ and }c=a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"535\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Here, we are told that the two quantities are equal. \n</p><p>Squaring both sides, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d85fec5eec9949379a797cab8103c226f4cee256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac{b}{c}=a^2*\\frac{b}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"116\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/190618b14628269c1edd0027bba89e680a8fb1c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ac+b=ba^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Looking at all answer choices, we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/4/9a444ee11a849f78793aa5ea721b6fc4e657a24f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ac=ba^2-b=b(a^2-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"193\" height=\"21\" />. \n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/7/0673e042d2295019ca774f7b4180fc2ecd004cab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\frac{b(a^2-1)}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"39\" />, and this is option C. Therefore chose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> as your answer.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px s